  "description": "Viento Gravel Bike\n\nThe word VIENTO is known in Spanish as WIND. Our version of the VIENTO is one that describes the feeling of floating in the wind; a powerful force that constantly moves forward and crushing monster mountain climbs like the wind . This Viento Gravel Bike and frame was designed with all-day ride handling comfort without any loss of performance. The components on the Viento have been carefully selected to give the best balance for a gravel road experience that is smooth and flawless. Like all VooDoo bicycles, this also has the perfect balance of geometry, materials, and component setup to help the rider go further, for longer and faster than over smooth or rough terrain. Thru-axles front and rear help to enable solid and stable hub to frame/fork interface with quick wheel changes. You will be enamored that a carbon bike like this adapts to the best of all worlds. Enjoy the Viento and rest with the thought in your mind of “Go with the wind.\"\n\nThe word VIENTO is known in Spanish as WIND. Our version of the VIENTO is one that describes the feeling of floating in the wind.",
